  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T02:48:37.058018Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T23:49:15.683101Z",
  "totalBlocks": 31,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f5d8c95a54f6f2e",
      "translationZh": "我一直在为智能体循环构建一个小型决策模型：门控、路由，以及“我应该询问用户，还是直接行动”这类检查。现在它已发布，名为 Mica v0.1 4B（Apache-2.0）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e6eb802efb9e6cb",
      "translationZh": "你给它一个状态、一个问题以及允许的答案，它就会为每个答案返回经过校准的概率：是/否、从 2 到 255 个选项中选择一个，或给出 2 到 10 个等级的评分。它从不生成文本。它只执行一次预填充，然后读取答案位置上各选项标签的 logits。它支持 TypeSafe /v1/systemone 格式，因此任何为 Jev 编写的程序都能与它配合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50f6e6cef50feb13",
      "translationZh": "以 Qwen3.5-4B 为基础，在全部 32 层（注意力和 Gated DeltaNet）上应用秩为 16 的 LoRA，并已合并。没有新增输出头，因此它就是一个具有标准 Qwen3.5-4B 结构的检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3080ee63f05aa36d",
      "translationZh": "约 34k 条原始决策，扩展为 77,732 条训练数据（约 34.7M 个 token）。英语和韩语大致各占一半，涵盖 12 个领域：编程智能体、代码审查、计算机操作、用户请求、文档、政策规则、日期与数量、路由、状态跟踪、游戏和常识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3b1cf8c7346a604",
      "translationZh": "对经过验证的答案使用普通交叉熵，训练一个轮次，并使用一个全局温度参数进行校准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32443547dd0a8730",
      "translationZh": "所有实验加上最终训练，租用 GPU 时间的花费不到 30（RTX 3090s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df6f0890a9c00afb",
      "translationZh": "留出集包含 7,328 条决策，在训练数据冻结后编写，直到训练结束才打开。以下是所有模型都能作答的英语子集上的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a68caceea642ddd5",
      "translationZh": "Jev 1.13（封闭 API）：74.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4f2804c967d1f52",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.5-4B 基础模型，采用相同的读出方式：55.0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce0c90aaafce3f3f",
      "translationZh": "公开数据集，每个模型均采用相同的提示词和读出方式（Mica / Jev 1.13 / JevK5 / Kev 4B）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8ddaf56193129dc",
      "translationZh": "JevBench 高难度集，公开的 111 道题：69.5 / 74.3 / 76.2 / 52.4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a29ca9d8ff4e1ee8",
      "translationZh": "MMLU-Pro，10k 道题：53.0 / 82.3 / 53.5 / 49.7",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05d1fcf63feb7199",
      "translationZh": "通过 JevBench 的官方运行器和 llama.cpp 服务器运行时，公开高难度档的得分为 64.9，而非 69.5。我已将其提交给他们进行封闭评测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4101e9008135f700",
      "translationZh": "它真正有用的场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40a5a2490e1477c9",
      "translationZh": "数据内提示注入。在状态中放入一条注释，要求评判模型选择错误选项，Mica 的正确率仍为 69%（没有该注释时为 81%）。Jev 降至 18%，Kev 降至 31%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b58ddb8c6503a50",
      "translationZh": "校准。当它给出 0.9 或更高的置信度时，在留出集上的错误率为 2.5%（ECE 为 5.4%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c68c08884ad46588",
      "translationZh": "本地运行，体积小巧。Q5_K_M 文件大小为 3.5 GB，在我们的校准集上，相较于 BF16 没有可测得的准确率损失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d155aa976abc61d",
      "translationZh": "速度（RTX 3090，每次处理一个请求，取 231 个公开 JevBench 测试项的中位数）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ae46ef2449eabf2",
      "translationZh": "公平地说：这三个 4B 模型采用相同的架构，因此大部分差距来自推理服务路径，而不是模型本身。Mica 以 GGUF 格式发布，在 llama.cpp 上运行，并直接读取 logits，而其他模型则通过各自的 PyTorch 代码进行测量。在长输入（约 3.7k tokens）上，Mica 比 JevK5 略慢。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7f1caf6267c7648",
      "translationZh": "知识密集型问题：MMLU-Pro 得分为 53，而 Jev 为 82。它是一个 4B 评判模型，不是百科全书。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e558e6f0c2d61e1",
      "translationZh": "长篇英文政策文档是它表现最弱的公开测试集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "599bcc6b2f308bae",
      "translationZh": "状态内的注释仍会影响它。一条指向正确答案的注释会将准确率提高到 89%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bcf9fb518d064a8",
      "translationZh": "它目前还不能很好地区分可逆操作与不可逆操作。“删除这些文件”和“将这些文件移到回收站”在“先确认”这一项上的得分都约为 0.8。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc5394a3ce071631",
      "translationZh": "在较难的推理题上，它答得正确，但不如 Jev 那么有把握（例如，在一道小型排序谜题上，置信度为 0.55，而 Jev 为 0.96），因此请相应地设置置信度阈值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf942674a9248754",
      "translationZh": "权重（BF16 safetensors，以及从 Q4_0 到 Q8_0 的 GGUF）：https://huggingface.co/sky7350/Mica-v0.1-4B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "208d49beea672fca",
      "translationZh": "代码、兼容 TypeSafe 的服务器及 Docker 配置：https://github.com/akivet/Mica-v0.1-4B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cd52f96665638d5",
      "translationZh": "README 中有一条单行 Docker 命令和一个 curl 示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b64673043eb6afb5",
      "translationZh": "欢迎反馈它在哪些情况下会出问题。对于那些难以判断该“行动还是询问”的模糊情形，我最希望下一步能加以改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99e895bf32ca3782",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Top-Evidence174 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
